Gleki,

If all you have left is the tried and wearied approach of accusing others
of destroying the langauge and driving out speakers then ... wait that's
what essentially every argument you put forth is founded on. You can wave
your hands and talk about some unnamed people I've 'driven out' at the same
time I point to the speakers I've brought to the language.

"Please, change your attitude."

My attitude is a direct response to being diminished and dismissed. I'll
change it when that changes.

